  "rationale": [
    "Reuse the existing FA3 VideoGenerationIR/MMG contracts, Model Router authority, HRB authority and Model Artifact Security admission rather than introduce a Wan-specific application authority.",
    "Use Wan2.2 as an initial free/open local execution candidate because upstream publishes code and model weights under Apache-2.0 and exposes T2V, I2V, TI2V, S2V and character animation paths.",
    "Do not treat upstream performance or hardware claims as current-host evidence.",
    "Keep LTX-family integration separate until its current model licence and runtime admission are independently evaluated."
  ],
